WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:07.810
Fold the sheet lengthwise in half, crease the spine, then open it flat.

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:15.285
Fold both top corners down until their edges meet evenly along the centerline.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:22.365
Fold both angled side edges inward to meet flush along the center crease.

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:31.128
Fold both halves together inward and press firmly from the nose down the keel.

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:37.588
Fold the top wing down over the angled ruler until the crease lies flat.

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:43.817
Flip the plane and fold the second wing down flush with the first wing.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:50.107
Pinch the bottom keel and open both wings out until they sit level.
